and bought so many  toys over the years that we now have  extended to five other organizations in  Burbank California where this hospital  is to make sure that we're taking joy  not just to the hospital but to other  kids in the area who need it and the  best part of it honestly in fact it's  all grassroots it is literally myself  and Michelle and Mike sending out emails  to our friends saying hey if you want to  join if you want to donate money if you  want to come shop we do all of the  shopping ourselves if you want to load  or unload toys from vans or put them in  the hospital we'll take any any help we  can get and it truly has become the best  the best part of our year it's amazing  how big it's grown that's amazing that's  something just be applauded that makes  you just even cooler than you already  are Lauren thank you so much for joining  me today I really appreciate it is there  anything else you wanted to plug before  you head out nope I think I think we  covered it all yeah I hope so and if if  you have if you listen you listen for  some reason you haven't watched The  Witcher watch it and not only watch The  Witcher you can go on Netflix  you can have a Lauren Schmidt historic  binge and watch her episodes of  daredevil umbrella Academy she wrote so  much the defenders it's all great stuff  Lauren thank you so much again for  joining me and I hope to talk to you  again soon thank you so much for having  me it was really fun
 

